Finished trial. Its sources and records are at
https://github.com/derekbreden/homesodamachine/tree/archive-finished-trials/hardware/printed-parts/fixtures/valve-socket-fit
valve_socket_fit.rs is the Rust port that tools/hsm/tooling/Cargo.toml still builds. The
magnet-retention and support-bottom-gap trial preparers load the valve models in
tighter-trial-v2/.
This marker keeps its published models off the site.
